{"latest_judgment":{"docno":null,"relevance":0,"reason":"The methyl bromide alternatives/phaseout query returned no new unskipped result beyond a previously judged EPA methyl bromide phaseout page.","learned":"Authoritative EPA methyl bromide evidence has been found, but this query is exhausted."},"action":{"op":"query","query":"(^ (+ \"nematode management\" \"nematode control\") nematicides (+ \"human health\" environmental toxicity) (+ withdrawn banned restricted))","reason":"Search broader nematode-control/management literature for direct statements that nematicides were withdrawn, banned, or restricted because of human-health, environmental, or toxicity concerns."}}
{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ (+ \"nematode management\" \"nematode control\") nematicides (+ \"human health\" environmental toxicity) (+ withdrawn banned restricted))"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_06_270229525#9_485579305","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q1507","rank":1,"snippet":"TABLE 2 Examples of recommended nematicidal dosages and treatments for some important crops1 Side-effects Future developments References \" , \"segment\": \"Economic and <cover>environmental justification should be evaluated before use. The omission of compounds does not imply that they are not equally suitable for nematode control. 2 kg a.i./ha unless otherwise stated. Liquid fumigants EDB, metam-sodium and 1,3-D are applied to soil that has been prepared for planting. The soil surface is compacted with a roller after treatment which helps to seal the fumigant in the soil. Compounds releasing methyl isothiocyanate (dazomet, metam-sodium) work best in soils at >15°C. In cooler soils, the period between treatment and planting may have to be extended to allow sufficient time for the product to disperse. The liquid fumigant DBCP is the only volatile compound that can be applied to growing plants without causing phytotoxicity. However, its manufacture has now ceased for toxicological reasons and its use is banned in many countries. Non-volatile nematicides.</cover>\" , \"start_char\": 6627.000000 , \"title\": \"Chemical control of nematodes: efficiency and side-effects\" ,"}}
