{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ (+ bionematicides bio-nematicides) (+ chemical synthetic nematicides) (+ toxic toxicity environmental health))"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_28_1548111942#1_3156134617","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q1529","rank":1,"snippet":"vehicles across North America, Europe and China, demand for lithium has widened. Lithium-Ion Battery Separator Industry 2020 Global Market research report expects the market size of lithium-ion battery separator to grow at a CAGR of 9% between 2021 and 2026. The market is expected to be valued at $5.29 billion by 2026. Companies such as FMC Corporation ( FMC - Get Rating ), Albemarle Corporation ( ALB - Get Rating) and Livent Corporation ( LTHM - Get Rating) use lithium as the raw material in their production process. With a robust growth in the market demand for goods produced by these companies driving their earnings and revenue, these stocks are attractive investments right now. FMC Corporation ( FMC - Get Rating) FMC manufactures and sells crop management products to promote fodder <cover>health and pest control. It primarily sells three kinds of chemical for optimal crop protection and management – herbicides, insecticides and fungicides, as well as develops biological bionematicides.</cover>\" , \"start_char\": 732.000000 , \"title\": \"FMC: 3 Lithium Stocks to Own for 2021\" , \"url\": \"https://stocknews.com/news/fmc-alb-lthm-3-lithium-stocks-to-own-for-2021/\" }"}}
