{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ (+ \"plant-parasitic nematodes\" \"plant parasitic nematodes\") (+ \"chemical control\" nematicides) (+ \"methyl bromide\" dbcp aldicarb) (+ banned withdrawn phaseout toxicity environmental))"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_41_164651097#5_387841976","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q1549","rank":7,"snippet":"\"Garden Bleach for Nematodes Garden Bleach for Nematodes Types Harmful Nematodes<cover>Methyl Bromide Successful Methods Beneficial Nematodes \" , \"segment\": \"Chemical nematicides are highly toxic and unsuitable for home garden use,” the report goes on to say. French marigolds exude a chemical that helps control harmful nematodes. Beneficial Nematodes There are up to 100 nematodes in a typical teaspoon of garden soil. The majority of nematodes function in the soil food web as nutrient recyclers. The nutritional content of vegetables and fruit is created by nematodes and other living organisms in the soil. They ingest raw organic materials and exude nutrients that are absorbed by vegetable and fruit roots. The University of Missouri Extension report on managing harmful nematodes in the garden recommends crop rotation, winter tilling to allow the soil to freeze, adding organic matter such as compost and soil solarization. 00:00 00:00 00:00 GO LIVE Facebook Twitter Email Embed Speed Normal Autoplay An unknown error has occurred Brought to you by LeafTV Brought to you by LeafTV References North Carolina University: Plant Parasitic Nematodes International Journal of Environmental </cover>Research & Public Health: Evaluation of the Effect of Ecologic on Root Knot ","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_00_1667865910#16_2916726411","rank":1,"relevance":3},{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_00_1667865910#17_2916728807","rank":2,"relevance":3},{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_01_614024996#15_563342684","rank":3,"relevance":3},{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_01_614024996#16_563345009","rank":4,"relevance":3},{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_18_508868484#0_571839510","rank":5,"relevance":3},{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_48_123562181#15_253441264","rank":6,"relevance":1}]}}
